The clients of the Bestway clouds (src/bestway/) and the fake cloud of the
tests were written in JavaScript for this project, from what these projects,
released under the MIT License, documented of the two clouds:
cdpuk/ha-bestway (https://github.com/cdpuk/ha-bestway: the Gizwits endpoints,
application id and error codes, the attribute vocabularies of each model and
their bubbles values, the SmartSpa gateway of the Bestway Connect app, its
login, Content-MD5 and JSON-string control quirks) and TA2k/ioBroker.bestway
(https://github.com/TA2k/ioBroker.bestway: the bindings and device data
endpoints). No code was copied. The endpoints and error answers were checked
against the live clouds with an unknown account on 2026-10-21.

